---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SystemFlowVisualizer from '../components/SystemFlowVisualizer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Solution Architecture Blueprint | NovaSphere Enterprise"
  description="Comprehensive Solution Architect & Fullstack Blueprint for Astro v5, Strapi CMS, Supabase PostgreSQL, and Vercel Edge Deployment."
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 space-y-16">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-nova-indigo/10 border border-nova-indigo/30 text-nova-cyan text-xs font-mono">
        <span>Solution Architect & Senior Fullstack Blueprint</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
        Enterprise Architecture Specification
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Engineered by <strong>Eka Prasetyo</strong> to solve the modern frontend trilemma: instantaneous edge delivery, scalable content authoring workflows, and robust relational transactional data modeling.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Live System Topology -->
    <SystemFlowVisualizer />

    <!-- Section 1: Executive Summary & Design Decisions -->
    <section class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-8 border border-white/10 space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-nova-cyan/20 text-nova-cyan flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm">01</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Architectural Principles & Design Philosophy</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-sm text-slate-300">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-dark-900/80 border border-white/5 space-y-2">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-nova-cyan font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Edge-First Rendering</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Content is served via static HTML at the edge by default. Astro partial prerendering hydrates interactive components strictly on user demand, dropping client-side JS by up to 90%.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-dark-900/80 border border-white/5 space-y-2">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-nova-indigo font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Decoupled Headless CMS</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Content governance is strictly decoupled from presentation. Strapi v5 manages editorial workflows, roles, and lifecycles without leaking backend rendering burdens to users.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-dark-900/80 border border-white/5 space-y-2">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-emerald-400 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">High-Throughput Pooling</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Supabase PostgreSQL is bridged using the Supavisor connection pooler on port 6543, eliminating database connection exhaustion under bursty serverless or container traffic.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 2: Data Flow & Webhook Synchronization -->
    <section class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-8 border border-white/10 space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-nova-indigo/20 text-nova-indigo flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm">02</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Event-Driven Content Invalidation Flow</h2>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        When an editor publishes an article or project in Strapi, a webhook event triggers automated cache revalidation or an on-demand deploy hook on Vercel:
      </p>

      <!-- Flow Chart ASCII / Code Representation -->
      <div class="bg-dark-950 p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300 overflow-x-auto space-y-4">
        <div class="text-slate-400">
          [ Content Editor ] 
          ──(1. Publish Event)──&gt; [ Strapi v5 Admin ] 
          ──(2. Lifecycle Hook)──&gt; [ Supabase PostgreSQL ]
        </div>
        <div class="text-slate-400">
          [ Strapi Webhook Engine ]
          ──(3. POST /api/revalidate)──&gt; [ Vercel Edge Middleware ]
          ──(4. On-Demand ISR Invalidation)──&gt; [ Global Edge CDN ]
        </div>
        <div class="text-emerald-400">
          [ End User Browser ] 
          &lt;──(5. Sub-30ms Cached HTML & Islands)── [ Vercel Edge PoP ]
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 3: Supabase Database Schema & RLS Security -->
    <section class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-8 border border-white/10 space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm">03</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Supabase PostgreSQL Schema & Security Blueprint</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-xs font-mono">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-dark-950 border border-white/5 space-y-3">
          <div class="text-nova-cyan font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Database Tables (DDL)</div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300">
            <li class="p-2 rounded bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5">
              <span class="text-white font-bold">public.projects</span>: id (UUID), title, slug, client, metrics (JSONB), tech_stack (JSONB), featured (BOOLEAN)
            </li>
            <li class="p-2 rounded bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5">
              <span class="text-white font-bold">public.articles</span>: id (UUID), title, slug, excerpt, content (TEXT), tags (JSONB), author, reading_time
            </li>
            <li class="p-2 rounded bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5">
              <span class="text-white font-bold">public.services</span>: id (UUID), name, slug, tagline, deliverables (JSONB), sort_order (INT)
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-dark-950 border border-white/5 space-y-3">
          <div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Row Level Security (RLS) & Pooling</div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300">
            <li class="p-2 rounded bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5">
              <span class="text-white font-bold">RLS Policies</span>: Read-only access enabled for anonymous queries (`FOR SELECT TO anon USING (true)`).
            </li>
            <li class="p-2 rounded bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5">
              <span class="text-white font-bold">Connection Port 6543</span>: Routed through Supavisor Transaction Pooler for zero cold-start exhaustion.
            </li>
            <li class="p-2 rounded bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5">
              <span class="text-white font-bold">Direct SSL Enforced</span>: TLS 1.3 enforced for all database read/write queries.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 4: Vercel Production Deployment Runbook -->
    <section class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-8 border border-white/10 space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-nova-violet/20 text-nova-violet flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm">04</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Vercel Deployment Architecture & Configuration</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300">
        <p class="text-sm font-sans text-slate-300">
          The Astro frontend uses the official <code>@astrojs/vercel</code> adapter with <code>output: 'hybrid'</code>. Static pages are pre-rendered during build, while dynamic API endpoints and on-demand pages execute on Vercel Edge Serverless functions.
        </p>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-dark-950 border border-white/5">
          <div class="text-slate-400 mb-2">// vercel.json configuration overview</div>
          <pre class="text-slate-200"><code>{`{
  "framework": "astro",
  "buildCommand": "npm run build",
  "outputDirectory": "dist",
  "cleanUrls": true,
  "headers": [
    {
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "X-Content-Type-Options", "value": "nosniff" },
        { "key": "X-Frame-Options", "value": "DENY" },
        { "key": "X-XSS-Protection", "value": "1; mode=block" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}`}</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 5: Telemetry API & Live Health Check -->
    <section class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-8 border border-white/10 space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Live System Telemetry</h3>
        <a href="/api/health" target="_blank" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-nova-cyan/10 border border-nova-cyan/20 text-nova-cyan text-xs font-mono hover:bg-nova-cyan/20 transition-colors">
          View JSON Endpoint &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
        Query the active operational status of the Astro runtime, Strapi headless CMS connection, and Supabase database health in real time.
      </p>
    </section>

  </div>
</Layout>
